  "prefLabel": "Plc 901.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 901.02 Applicability. Subject to the exemptions provided in RSA 328-B:10, reprinted in Appendix B, this chapter shall apply to any individual who intends to practice or who does practice massage therapy in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
